<title>USA: Evergreen Resources natgas reserves rose.</title>
<headline>Evergreen Resources natgas reserves rose.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Evergreen Resources Inc said Monday ots proved natural gas reserves were 150.7 billion cubic feet as of December 31, 1996, Evergreen's new fiscal year-end, an increase of 69.8 billion cubic feet or about 86 percent over levels at March 31, 1996, the former fiscal year end. ((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
